WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Kritzelkönig – Draw & Guess with friends.

00:05.400 --> 00:10.800
1) Create a room and share the 4-digit code.

00:10.800 --> 00:16.200
2) One player gets a word and draws it.

00:16.200 --> 00:21.600
3) The others guess – by typing or by voice.

00:21.600 --> 00:27.000
4) The faster you guess, the more points.

00:27.000 --> 00:33.000
Solo or in teams, for big and small.

00:33.000 --> 00:38.400
Most points wins. Play now!
